{"version":1,"content":"<p>，據《華爾街日報》報道，知情人士稱，由於投資者需求強勁，Anthropic的首次公開招股(IPO)定價預計將高於此前公佈的發行價區間。這表明，市場動蕩以及英偉達內部的人事風波，並未削弱投資者對AI熱潮的熱情。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586918.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T07:17:26.007738+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T07:04:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T07:10:40.321844+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:10:40.321844+00:00","content_hash":"af32ec22e82cef17bc61609d3e4e57d795074761c05be92ec044feda48380d51","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}